{"product_id":"nasty-super-cool-pineapple-ice-salt","title":"Nasty Super Cool - Pineapple Ice Salt","description":"\u003cp\u003ePineapple Ice Salt – Nasty Super Cool, Pineapple ice blends ripe pineapple’s juicy sweetness with an icy chill for a perfectly balanced, refreshing experience.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan\u003eNASTY Juice Super Cool series is engineered frost—not just typical menthol or mint. Each flavour delivers a signature chill that enhances without muting bold, juicy top notes. Designed for full-intensity coolness. it provides a crisp, clean sensation that refreshes the palate without overpowering, ensuring flavour hits cold and clean every time..\u003c\/span\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eSalt Details:\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eBottle Size: 30ML\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eNicotine Strengths: 35MG \u0026amp; 50MG\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eType: Nicotine Salt E-liquid\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eVG\/PG Ratio: 50\/50 – Best for pod devices\u003cbr\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eBrand: Nasty Juice\u003cbr\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eOrigin: Malaysia\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e","brand":"Nasty","offers":[{"title":"35MG","offer_id":42006261497911,"sku":"Nasty Super Cool - Pineapple Ice - 35 MG","price":1750.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":true},{"title":"50MG","offer_id":42006261530679,"sku":"Nasty Super Cool - Pineapple Ice - 50 MG","price":1750.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":false}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0599\/6799\/5959\/files\/Pineapple-Ice_1024x1024_2x_765cf53c-47d2-468a-83ed-657677d7652f.webp?v=1764628629","url":"https:\/\/[YOUR DOMAIN]\/products\/nasty-super-cool-pineapple-ice-salt","provider":"[YOUR BRAND]","version":"1.0","type":"link"}




